  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">quran with urdu translation</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Download the Holy Quran with Word-by-Word Urdu Translation</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Deepen your understanding of the Quran with our detailed, word-by-word Urdu translation, now available in a convenient PDF format. Perfect for both daily readings and in-depth study, this translation helps Urdu-speaking individuals connect more intimately with the divine text. Access it easily from home or on the go, and embark on a profound journey through the Quranic teachings.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Download your free copy today and bring the timeless messages of the Quran closer to your heart.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://archive.org/compress/holyquran_wordbyword_urdutranslation_pdf/formats=IMAGE%20CONTAINER%20PDF&amp;file=/holyquran_wordbyword_urdutranslation_pdf.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"525\" height=\"668\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/مممم.png\" alt=\"quran with urdu translation\" class=\"wp-image-6106\" style=\"width:275px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/مممم.png 525w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/مممم-236x300.png 236w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 525px) 100vw, 525px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://archive.org/embed/holyquran_wordbyword_urdutranslation_pdf\" width=\"560\" height=\"384\" frameborder=\"0\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"true\" mozallowfullscreen=\"true\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://archive.org/compress/holyquran_wordbyword_urdutranslation_pdf/formats=IMAGE%20CONTAINER%20PDF&amp;file=/holyquran_wordbyword_urdutranslation_pdf.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5735\" style=\"width:85px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1.png 256w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 256px) 100vw, 256px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><a href=\"https://quranbook.org/%d8%b5%d9%88%d8%aa-%d9%85%d9%83%d8%a9-%d8%b9%d8%a8%d8%af-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a8%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%b7/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">صوت مكة عبد الباسط</a></h2>\n",
